              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In addition, participants were educated in how\nto conduct the 'Prevention and Control of Infection' audit at the bedside\nthrough simulated practice. The critical importance of ensuring effective\ncollaboration and ensuring around-the-clock compliance to infection control\npractices in clinical teams were some of the core objectives that were\nachieved.\n\n\n\n",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
